Birth Tourism is a real thing. There's over 100 surrogacy operations that are Chinese-run in California.

Read the report: The New Face of Birth Tourism: Chinese Nationals, American Surrogates, and Birthright Citizenship by Emma Waters and Simon Hankinson. heritage.org/china/report/th…

@emlwaters is a Senior Policy Analyst in the Center for Technology and the Human Person and @WatchfulWaiter1 is a Senior Research Fellow in the Border Security and Immigration Center at The Heritage Foundation.

